      "short_description": "All Elite Wrestling (AEW) is a professional wrestling promotion founded in 2019 by Tony Khan, with support from his father, Shahid Khan. AEW aims to provide a major alternative to WWE through innovative storytelling and a diverse roster. The company quickly gained traction with its inaugural event, Double or Nothing, in May 2019, and has since expanded its reach with weekly television shows and international events.\n\nAEW produces weekly programs such as AEW Dynamite and AEW Collision, along with major pay-per-view events like All In and All Out. The promotion hosts over 100 live events annually worldwide and features a talented roster that includes notable wrestlers like Chris Jericho, Kenny Omega, and Jon Moxley. AEW also integrates content from Ring of Honor and offers streaming options on platforms like Max, focusing on high-quality matches and engaging storylines. Its broadcasts reach audiences in over 140 countries and eight languages, appealing to wrestling fans globally.",
